      "description": "Leslie Pitter and Eric Cox at a cricket match in Brisbane, 1939.\nCaption on photo: A military atmosphere pervaded at the Sheffield Shield match at Woolloongabba yesterday afternoon. Menfolk, smart in military, naval and air force uniform, were everywhere, and many of them squired smart local younger-setters. During the interval sock knitting was fashionable...A striking and attractive study was Miss Leslie Pitter who wore a black Swiss embroidery frock and her modish matching chapeau showed the triple bow finish.",
